   "options": "<div style='background:#fef9e7;border-left:4px solid #f1c40f;padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:8px'><strong>RETENTION RULE</strong> &mdash; Drives the weekly purge scheduler. <strong>Test in 'Anonymize' mode for at least one cycle before switching to 'Delete'.</strong> Per HR Settings.dpdp_purge_max_per_run, the purge processes at most N records per run as a safety bound.</div>"
